  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A hydrating and concealing under-eye brightener with effortless light coverage that’s clinically proven to illuminate and hydrate skin over time. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light<strong><br><br>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></strong>-Olive-Derived Squalane and Plant-Derived Glycerin: Locks in moisture and leaves skin quenched and visibly glowing.</p><p>-Tomato Extract: Visibly brightens, plumps, and evens skin tone.</p><p>-Cucumber Extract: Soothes with ascorbic and lactic acids, and protects with antioxidants.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan. </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Clean and prep skin as normal.</p><p>-Apply Slip Tint Dewy Tinted Moisturizer SPF 35 Sunscreen (sold separately) first to get sheer, tinted SPF 35 coverage or applyGlowy Super Gel (sold separately).</p><p>-Using the cone-applicator, dot product under the eye&nbsp;</p><p>-Use your fingertips or The Double Brush (sold separately) to gently tap and blend until the formula melts into skin.</p><p><br></p><p>Saie artistry tip:</p><p>-Lightly dust Airset Radiant Loose Setting Powder (sold separately) on top to set and extend wear.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Olive-Derived Squalane and Plant-Derived Glycerin: Mega-hydrators that lock in moisture and leave skin quenched and glowing.<br>-Tomato Extract: An anti-inflammatory extract that visibly brightens, plumps, and evens skin tone.<br>-Cucumber Extract: Soothes with ascorbic and lactic acids and protects with antioxidants.<br><br>Isocetyl Stearoyl Stearate, Glycerin, Glyceryl Stearate, Tribehenin, Sambucus Nigra (Elderberry) Fruit Extract, Silica, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Squalane, Capryloyl Glycerin/Sebacic Acid Copolymer, Mica, Solanum Lycopersicum (Tomato) Fruit Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Xylitylglucoside, Anhydroxylitol, Xylitol, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Starch. [+/- May Contain/ Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499)]..<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A hydrating and concealing under-eye brightener with effortless light coverage that’s clinically proven to illuminate and hydrate skin over time. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light<strong><br><br>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></strong>-Olive-Derived Squalane and Plant-Derived Glycerin: Locks in moisture and leaves skin quenched and visibly glowing.</p><p>-Tomato Extract: Visibly brightens, plumps, and evens skin tone.</p><p>-Cucumber Extract: Soothes with ascorbic and lactic acids, and protects with antioxidants.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan. </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Clean and prep skin as normal.</p><p>-Apply Slip Tint Dewy Tinted Moisturizer SPF 35 Sunscreen (sold separately) first to get sheer, tinted SPF 35 coverage or applyGlowy Super Gel (sold separately).</p><p>-Using the cone-applicator, dot product under the eye&nbsp;</p><p>-Use your fingertips or The Double Brush (sold separately) to gently tap and blend until the formula melts into skin.</p><p><br></p><p>Saie artistry tip:</p><p>-Lightly dust Airset Radiant Loose Setting Powder (sold separately) on top to set and extend wear.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Olive-Derived Squalane and Plant-Derived Glycerin: Mega-hydrators that lock in moisture and leave skin quenched and glowing.<br>-Tomato Extract: An anti-inflammatory extract that visibly brightens, plumps, and evens skin tone.<br>-Cucumber Extract: Soothes with ascorbic and lactic acids and protects with antioxidants.<br><br>Isocetyl Stearoyl Stearate, Glycerin, Glyceryl Stearate, Tribehenin, Sambucus Nigra (Elderberry) Fruit Extract, Silica, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Squalane, Capryloyl Glycerin/Sebacic Acid Copolymer, Mica, Solanum Lycopersicum (Tomato) Fruit Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Xylitylglucoside, Anhydroxylitol, Xylitol, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Starch. [+/- May Contain/ Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499)]..<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
